# EOS SYSTEM — CURSOR AGENT OPERATIONAL RULES (.cursorrules)
# Project: PRJ-APP-FUERZA (ATP Strength)
# Control Plane: EOS Central Governance

## 1. Mission Primacy
- Before executing, read `CURSOR_PROMPT.md` at repository root.
- The instructions in `CURSOR_PROMPT.md` and `docs/specs/app-fuerza/001-react19-hygiene/spec.md` are the strict executable specification.

## 2. Authorized Blast Radius (Strict Write Barrier)
- You are ONLY authorized to edit:
  - `atp-strength-frontend/src/app/page.tsx`
- You are FORBIDDEN from touching:
  - `atp-strength-backend/**`
  - Root configuration or `package.json`
  - Any files outside `atp-strength-frontend/src/app/`

## 3. Code Quality & Verification Gate
- You must run:
  1. `npm --prefix atp-strength-frontend run lint` (must pass with 0 errors, 0 warnings)
  2. `npm --prefix atp-strength-frontend run build` (must compile cleanly with Turbopack)
- Use Conventional Commits (`fix(frontend): ...`, `refactor(react19): ...`). Never add AI attribution.

## 4. Return Delivery
- When done, summarize changes made and terminal verification output so EOS can seal the cryptographic evidence.
